{"author":["Elastic","Austin Songer"],"description":"检测Windows经PowerShell删除卷影副本。对应需求：影响破坏。官方：Volume Shadow Copy Deletion via PowerShell。","from":"now-9m","index":["endgame-*","logs-crowdstrike.fdr*","logs-endpoint.events.process-*","logs-m365_defender.event-*","logs-sentinel_one_cloud_funnel.*","logs-system.security*","logs-windows.forwarded*","logs-windows.sysmon_operational-*","winlogbeat-*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows经PowerShell删除卷影副本","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/previous-versions/windows/desktop/vsswmi/win32-shadowcopy","https://powershell.one/wmi/root/cimv2/win32_shadowcopy","https://www.fortinet.com/blog/threat-research/stomping-shadow-copies-a-second-look-into-deletion-methods"],"risk_score":73,"rule_id":"d99a037b-c8e2-47a5-97b9-170d076827c4","severity":"high","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 影响破坏","来源: 默认","对应需求: 影响破坏"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.type == \"start\" and\n  process.name : (\"powershell.exe\", \"pwsh.exe\", \"powershell_ise.exe\") and\n  process.args : (\"*Get-WmiObject*\", \"*gwmi*\", \"*Get-CimInstance*\", \"*gcim*\") and\n  process.args : (\"*Win32_ShadowCopy*\") and\n  process.args : (\"*.Delete()*\", \"*Remove-WmiObject*\", \"*rwmi*\", \"*Remove-CimInstance*\", \"*rcim*\")\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows经PowerShell删除卷影副本\n\n### 为何重要\n破坏可用性或加密数据\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","message"]},"threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1490","name":"Inhibit System Recovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1490/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0040","name":"Impact","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0040/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1047","name":"Windows Management Instrumentation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1047/"},{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1059.001","name":"PowerShell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"},{"package":"windows","version":"*"},{"package":"system","version":"*"},{"package":"m365_defender","version":"*"},{"package":"sentinel_one_cloud_funnel","version":"*"},{"package":"crowdstrike","version":"*"}],"version":320,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
